      "id": "start_focus_002_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "迷ったら、見えるものから始めて。開く、読む、書く。順番はそれで十分。",
      "translatedText": "If you hesitate, start with something visible: open, read, write. That order is enough.",
